        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu asema: “Wakati utakuja ambapo nitakuwa Mungu wa jamaa zote za Israeli nao watakuwa watu wangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.1",
